            0.261,
            0.886,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Even fractions greater than 1 can be located on the number line in this way. For example, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 9 } { 4 } } = 2 { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " so it lies between 2 and 3. We divide the interval between 2 and 3 into four equal parts and move one part to the right of 2. See Fig. 3.6."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
